---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE, CATEGORIES } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="About" description="About The Finer Things Journal, an independent journal of culture, film, literature, art & objects that began on Instagram. What “finer” means here, and how to connect.">
  <section class="page-head wrap reveal">
    <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
    <h1>The <em>Journal</em></h1>
    <p>{SITE.tagline}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap about reveal" style="animation-delay:.15s">
    <div class="grain portrait logo-card" style="aspect-ratio: 4 / 5">
      <img src="/logo-transparent.png" alt="The Finer Things Journal logo" />
    </div>

    <div class="text">
      <p>
        The Finer Things Journal began as small squares on Instagram: a still from a film, a sentence
        underlined in pencil, the curve of a cup on a windowsill. This is where those squares get room to breathe.
      </p>
      <p>
        The word “finer” can sound expensive. Here, it has more to do with what makes something worth our time.
        That might be the work behind an object, the care in a sentence, or a story that helps us recognise
        something in our own lives. Price and polish tell us very little about whether we will remember it.
      </p>
      <p>
        The journal moves between a handful of subjects, though they tend to bleed into one another.
      </p>
      <ul class="topics">
        {CATEGORIES.map((c) => (
          <li><a href={`/?type=${c.id}`}>{c.label}</a></li>
        ))}
      </ul>

      <hr class="rule" />

      <h2>Connect</h2>
      <p>
        If something here stayed with you, I'd love to hear about it. The conversation mostly happens on Instagram.
      </p>
      <a class="cta eyebrow" href={SITE.instagram.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        {SITE.instagram.handle} →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 6fr);
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    align-items: start;
    max-width: 1080px;
  }
  .about :global(.portrait) { position: sticky; top: 2rem; }
  .logo-card { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: #efe8dc; }
  .logo-card img { width: 24%; height: auto; filter: none; }
  /* All About paragraphs share the same serif style */
  .text p {
    margin: 0 0 1.4rem;
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.4vw, 1.6rem);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  .topics {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 2.75rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem 0;
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }
  .topics li:not(:last-child)::after { content: ','; margin-right: 0.5em; color: var(--ink-faint); }
  .topics a { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); transition: border-color 0.3s; }
  .topics a:hover { border-color: var(--ink); }
  h2 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem;
  }
  .cta {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--ink);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
    padding-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .about { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .about :global(.portrait) { position: static; max-width: 420px; }
  }
</style>
